<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13864] Assertion error happens on stale latch&apos;s acknowledge</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13864</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There are several Assertion errors on TC logs, they are bounded with exchange latch.&lt;br/&gt;
 Seem it happens because latch manager is not handling stale acknowledge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
